    "identity": "No client memberId/openId/fileID/URL accepted; current SDK actor only; first-time users must establish identity with consent.",
    "requestLimits": "Cloud envelope: avatar/media image 131072 bytes; staff learning catalog 262144; staff club content/history 65536; all other actions 16384. Decoded image max65536 bytes. Domain guard uses equivalent bounded character limits.",
    "imageValidation": "Canonical base64, decoded at most 65536 bytes; JPEG/PNG signatures, dimensions 1..1024 and basic segment/chunk structure; not a full decoder or EXIF scrubber.",
    "storage": "Server uploads each attempt to a unique member-avatars/{trustedMemberId}/{uuid}.{jpg|png} private object; direct client read/write denied.",
    "concurrency": "Revision is checked before and after upload. Conflict cleans only an unbound unique upload. Unknown database commit outcome preserves any bound object. Readback signs then rechecks actor and revision.",
    "cleanup": "Old-image cleanup failure is recorded with action/code only and does not turn a committed profile into a reported save failure; upload transport uncertainty may leave an orphan for later reconciliation.",
